# EODHD All-in-One subscription key for blive's EODHD data-source adapters
# (per ADR-014 — data sources via clean API abstraction — and ADR-035
# — secrets handling discipline). Copy this file to
# `~/.blive/secrets/eodhd.env`, fill in the value, and `chmod 600`.
#
# blive never reads from this in-repo example file at runtime; it is
# documentation only. The runtime loader (`blive.adapters.shared.credentials`)
# resolves values from environment variables first, then from
# `~/.blive/secrets/eodhd.env`. Missing required fields raise
# `CredentialsMissing` with a message naming this file.

# Required. Your EODHD All-in-One API token. Get it from
# https://eodhd.com/cp/dashboard.
EODHD_API_KEY=replace-with-your-eodhd-api-key
